<title>NETHERLANDS: SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-April.</title>
<headline>SGS Europe cocoa stock estimates down at end-April.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS Warehouse Services gave the following estimates of cocoa in store as of the end of April/early May. All figures in tonnes.</p>
<p>		    Total	Of which for the buffer stock</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM	 609,000    32,786.931 (inc 4,425.231 forw sales)</p>
<p>HAMBURG/BREMEN  145,700    15,508.418</p>
<p>ANTWERP	   115,945     1,449.828 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>UK (ALL PORTS)   63,000     1,799.447 (all forw sales)</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM	  15,750     4,960.413 (inc 2,092.783 forw sales)</p>
<p>The following are changes to month-earlier levels:</p>
<p>AMSTERDAM     DOWN 27,000     HAMBURG/BREMEN    DOWN 6,400</p>
<p>ANTWERP	 UP   10,305     UK (ALL PORTS)    DOWN 2,700</p>
<p>ROTTERDAM     DOWN    500</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
